# Freminet Furina Escoffier Xianyun. ~20s Rot. Freminet Phys plunge with Escoffier subDPS. Executes 1 Shattering Pressure combo while plunging. Escoffier bursts as available. OHC > VV Xianyun, but bubbles may miss. 50% Collisions.

# Team - Options ordered by DPS
freminet char lvl=90/90 cons=6 talent=9,9,9;
freminet add weapon="serpent" refine=1 lvl=90/90 +params=[stacks=5];
#freminet add weapon="fruitfulhook" refine=1 lvl=90/90;
